    "en": {
      "원통 롤러 베어링 (단열) | ILJIN 베어링": "Cylindrical Roller Bearings (Single Row) | ILJIN Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>원통 롤러 베어링 (단열)</h2> <p>롤러와 내·외륜의 궤도면이 선접촉하므로 경방향 하중의 부하능력이 크고, 분리형이므로 조립·해체가 간편하며, 억지 끼워맞춤이 가능합니다.</p> <p>고속회전이 필요한 용도에도 주로 사용합니다.</p> <p>NU/NJ/NUP/N/NF 등 궤도륜 형상별로 다양한 형번이 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Cylindrical Roller Bearings</p> <h2>Cylindrical Roller Bearings (Single Row)</h2> <p>Since the rollers make line contact with the raceway surfaces of the inner and outer rings, radial load capacity is high; being a separable design, assembly and disassembly are easy, and interference fits are possible.</p> <p>Also widely used in applications requiring high-speed rotation.</p> <p>A variety of model numbers are supplied by raceway ring shape, including NU/NJ/NUP/N/NF types.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>",
      "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/cylindrical_roller.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도 (좌측부터 NU·NJ·NUP·N·NF형)\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">좌측부터 NU·NJ·NUP형(외륜에 궤도턱, F<sub>w</sub>=내륜 궤도면 지름) · N·NF형(내륜에 궤도턱, E<sub>w</sub>=외륜 궤도면 지름) — NJ·NUP는 NU와, NF는 N과 외경(D)이 같아 원본 도면에 D 표기가 생략되어 있습니다.</span></p>": "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/cylindrical_roller.png\" alt=\"Structural Cross-Section Diagram (NU·NJ·NUP·N·NF types, left to right)\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d (bore) · D (outer diameter) · Tolerance (d/D) · B (width)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">From left: NU, NJ, NUP types (locating ribs on the outer ring, F<sub>w</sub>=inner ring raceway diameter) · N, NF types (locating ribs on the inner ring, E<sub>w</sub>=outer ring raceway diameter) — since NJ/NUP share the same outer diameter (D) as NU, and NF shares the same outer diameter (D) as N, the D notation is omitted in the original drawing.</span></p>",
      "<label for=\"crbFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"crbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: NU210 또는 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">": "<label for=\"crbFilter\">Search by Model / Spec</label> <input id=\"crbFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. NU210 or 50*90\" autocomplete=\"off\">",
